WEBVTT

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:12.780
All done!

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.030
Here you go, Celine.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.660
Good morning.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.370
Good morning, Nana-san.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.210
Yo, Celine.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.040
Please don't stare so much.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.630
Ah! Momo!

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:10.800
Good morning, Rito-san.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:14.840
As usual, when you're asleep you're very-

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.760
How many times have I told you!?

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:18.930
Stop sneaking into my room!

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.430
Let's keep giving it our best, Rito-san.

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:22.430
Giving our best?

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:23.770
To what?

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:30.900
W-Wait...

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.740
Nana-san, would you go wake Rito for me?

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.740
W-Why do I have to?!

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:20.320
<b>fushigi na yasuragi kanshou</b>

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:20.320
<b>不思議な安らぎ観賞</b>

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:20.320
<b>This strange feeling of peaceful enjoyment</b>

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.910
<b>shibaraku kono mama</b>

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.910
<b>しばらくこのまま</b>

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.910
<b>Will continue for a while</b>

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:27.500
<b>rikai funou puroburemu bousou</b>

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:27.500
<b>理解不能プロブレム暴走</b>

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:27.500
<b>An impossible to solve problem runs wild</b>

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.790
<b>genin wa?</b>

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.790
<b>原因は？</b>

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.790
<b>And the cause is?</b>

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:37.260
<b>kimi to iru to kudaranai oshie wasureru</b>

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:37.260
<b>君といるとくだらない教え忘れる</b>

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:37.260
<b>Whenever I'm with you, I forget all about these boring lessons</b>

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:45.060
<b>kono henka kara umaretahonshin ukeireyou</b>

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:45.060
<b>この変化から生まれた本心受け入れよう</b>

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:45.060
<b>I want you to accept the true feelings born from this change</b>

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:49.020
<b>harimegutta saisho no kokoro</b>

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:49.020
<b>張り巡った最初の心</b>

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:49.020
<b>I reeled in the first heart I could hook</b>

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:52.480
<b>taguriyose sotto seebushita</b>

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:52.480
<b>手繰り寄せそっとセーブした</b>

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:52.480
<b>Carefully saving it</b>

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:57.110
<b>hyouteki ni fukuzatsu na mune no yami takushite</b>

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:57.110
<b>標的に複雑な胸の闇託して</b>

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:57.110
<b>I use the complicated darkness in my heart on my target</b>

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.200
<b>Care me! Care me! Care me! Care me!</b>

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.200
<b></b>

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.200
<b></b>

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:06.200
<b>naiteru kokoro atatamete yatto kizuita</b>

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:06.200
<b>泣いてる心温めてやっと気づいた</b>

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:06.200
<b>As I warmed the crying heart, I finally realised</b>

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:15.040
<b>watashi no himitsu heiki wa nani yori mo tsuyoku katakumusunda</b>

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:15.040
<b>私の秘密兵器はなによりも強く硬く結んだ</b>

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:15.040
<b>That more than anything, my secret weapon is strongly, firmly bound</b>

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:18.300
<b>kimi to no tsunagari</b>

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:18.300
<b>君との繋がり</b>

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:18.300
<b>With my connection to you</b>

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.420
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.420
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.420
<b>「Unconsciously</b>

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.420
<b>「Unconsciously</b>

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.420
<b>~Light Head☆Beating Heart~」</b>

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.420
<b>~Light Head☆Beating Heart~」</b>

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.310
Now, let's see...

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:34.770
Peke!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.070
Yes, Lala-sama?

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.990
So refreshing!

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.780
Good morning!

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.330
Good morning, Lala-san.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.410
Breakfast is ready.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.700
Thank you!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.040
Peke, hurry up!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.220
Lala, I'm sorry!

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.720
I tripped!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:06.600
Why, you...!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.060
Not only Momo, but big sister, too!?

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.640
Wait, it's not like that! That's not it!

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:12.980
What do you mean "It's not like that"!?

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.980
Good morning.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.700
You're all ready.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.200
Shall we go?

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:57.860
A test?

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.860
You did study, didn't you?

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.150
I did, but...

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:05.070
I don't really understand Earth history.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.450
Mea!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.410
Hm?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.240
Nana-chan!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.200
Yo!

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.540
Morning!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.660
Morning, Mea-chan.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:16.670
Hey, Rito.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.830
Don't get any closer than that.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.840
You have to be careful, Mea.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:24.670
He's a beast, so you never know what he'll do.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:25.880
What he'll do?

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.760
What would he do to me?

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:28.970
Something perverted!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.220
No, I won't.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:34.640
Senpai, are you finally in the mood to lick me?

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.430
Eh!?

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:36.690
How wonderful!

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:40.480
When... did you make a promise like that{...}?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.440
I didn't!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.860
That's no good whatsoever!

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:46.280
Come on Mea, let's go!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.700
See you later, Senpai!

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:51.870
Those two sure do get along well.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:52.490
Yeah.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:54.870
What is it?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.210
Rito-san, please be careful.

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:00.250
Mea-san is... um...

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.130
...A trans weapon. {Trans?}

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.000
Yes.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:07.760
It doesn't seem like she's done anything since then, but...

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.430
...just in case.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.470
Okay, I understand.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.350
Ouch...

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.560
Y-Yami!?

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.150
Oh, my.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.650
Right after I said that, too.

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:26.860
As expected of Rito-san.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:29.910
Yuuki Rito.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:30.490
Yes!?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.460
Please don't forget, Yuuki Rito.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.590
I'm after your life.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:43.710
Yes.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.550
Y-Yami-san, it wasn't on purpose!

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.470
Please move out of the way, Princess Momo.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:52.800
It seems I must teach this man thoroughly.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.510
Sorry about that, Yami-chan.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.430
Rito doesn't have any bad intentions.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.640
Please forgive him.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.190
Yuuki Rito.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.610
Yes!?

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.150
You should thank Princess Lala.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.030
Yes.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.950
As expected of you, Onee-sama.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.330
Don't worry.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.830
Despite what it seems, Yami-san is holding back.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:18.950
This is her holding back!?

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:19.750
That's right.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.920
She's a legendary assassin.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.790
If she were serious, right about now you'd be...

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:30.670
But this could be proof that the plan is making good progress, couldn't it?

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.010
The plan...

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.180
The harem plan.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:43.520
Please don't forget.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:47.900
There are many girls who can become happy depending on you, Rito-san.

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.950
What will you do, Rito-san?

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:54.570
I'll help you as much as I'm able.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:59.500
Let's make your harem, Rito-san.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.080
So we can all be happy.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.090
Yuuki-kun?

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.840
What's wrong?

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.260
Sairenji.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.390
Oh, my.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.800
I'll be going now, then.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:19.640
Haruna-san, please take care of Rito-san.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:20.350
Eh?

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:21.020
Um...

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.730
See you later, Momo!

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.480
See you, Onee-sama!

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.440
T-Thanks, Sairenji.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:35.610
Okay, it's good now.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:36.820
Did something happen?

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.540
Oh... no, I just fell down.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.330
Is that so?

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:47.790
Yuuki-kun, you can be a little clumsy sometimes, huh?

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:48.540
Yeah...

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.800
Thank you, Sairenji.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:58.430
Haruna, you're so kind!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.810
Lala-san!

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.430
Eh, are you serious!?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:04.520
Yeah, I'm serious!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.310
Risa! Mio!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.190
Yo!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.650
Energetic as usual today, aren't you, Lala-chi?

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.400
Rito-kun!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.530
Whoa, Run!

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:16.240
Are you off work today?

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.410
I'm off for the morning today.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.780
So that's why I came to see you, Rito-kun.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:21.990
You two!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.160
What are you doing so early in the morning!?

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.790
Kotegawa-san, you're so strict.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.290
This is school!

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.050
So it's okay outside of school?

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:32.550
So shameless!

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:33.420
Hey, Haruna.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.550
W-What is it?

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:38.010
Why don't you try to tell Rito you love him today?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.490
Haruna!

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.490
Just finished your club activities?

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.250
Nana-chan, what are you doing here so late?

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.620
I got a bad mark, so I have supplementary lessons.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.250
I see...

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.460
Now that I think about it, Yuuki-kun said he had supplementary lessons, too.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.550
So I'm at the same level as him, huh?

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.130
I know!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.590
I'll give you one of these, Haruna.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:25.390
It's a Devilukean sports drink I got from Zastin yesterday!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.680
It's really good!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.230
It really is good!

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.270
Isn't it?

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.400
I've liked it since long ago.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.940
Haruna-san.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.900
Momo-chan.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.860
I thought you went home.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.320
I had a little something to do.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:43.200
The truth is, I was actually waiting for Rito-san.

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:44.830
More importantly, Haruna-san.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:48.830
Did you make any progress with Rito-san?

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.000
What are you talking about so suddenly!?

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.580
That's right, Momo!

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:55.000
I was just wondering.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.340
Progress...

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.760
It didn't go well?

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.890
Yeah...

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:06.390
Or rather, I didn't know what I should do.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:07.980
You didn't know what to do?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.190
I told Lala-san about my feelings,

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:14.520
and she said "Let's give it our best for love!", but...

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:17.820
When I think about it, even if it went well...

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.400
Only one person would go out with Yuuki-kun, right?

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:22.910
Even if you love the same person,

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:26.790
it would turn out like a competition in the end.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.920
I'm kind of bad with things like that...

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:34.420
You're so kind, Haruna-san.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.840
Momo-chan, you knew?

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.010
But, Haruna-san.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:42.680
I think...

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:47.680
...Believing only one person can become happy is an antiquated way of thinking.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.850
In space, a harem...

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:55.360
Or rather... polygamy, is not uncommon.

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:56.730
In other words...

00:11:56.730 --> 00:12:05.370
In space, Onee-sama and Haruna-san can both marry Rito-san and live happily together!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.870
Eh!?

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.790
Is that true!?

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:09.450
Oh.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.410
You should have been learned about that at the royal palace as well.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:15.630
B-But, Yuuki-kun and I are both Earthlings.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:17.420
That's not true.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:20.460
Because Rito-san is not just an Earthling,

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.680
he's the next ruler of Deviluke.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.180
If everyone can be happy

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:30.680
I don't think there's any reason to be restricted by the Earth's rules.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:35.310
This is within the world of adults, so it's too soon for me though.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.310
I see!

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:40.360
So that's why Lala-san was in such high spirits!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:44.450
Lala-san and I both marrying Yuuki-kun...!

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:48.200
In that case, it certainly wouldn't become a competition.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.080
But it's no good.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.700
That doesn't make sense!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.370
Huh?

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.210
Is that a closed-minded way of thinking{...}?

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:58.590
Lala-san thought of a way for everyone to be happy,

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:01.960
and yet I'm thinking only of my own happiness?

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:05.430
But... but, but...

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.470
Huh?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.510
That's right.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:10.470
It's not only Rito-san's heart I'll have to change.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:15.480
Haruna-san is the fulcrum for the possibility of Rito-san's harem.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.480
If I can get her to join...

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:25.240
Yuuki-kun, let's make your harem.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:30.830
If you agree to make it, you can untie this ribbon.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.250
I promise I'll do it!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.880
Don't be in such a hurry!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.010
It's no good, you can't do that!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.510
That kind of thing is wrong!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:51.510
The world of adults is different from fairytales.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.350
That may be so, but...

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.680
Haruna, say something!

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:56.520
Hm?

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.270
Me?

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:02.570
I see... space sure is amazing.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:07.950
The idea is already... that, you know?

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:12.450
Out!

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.160
Like that.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.250
Haruna?

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.080
What's with this strange mood?

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.830
Hey, calm down!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:19.830
Hm?

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.670
What's going on with you?

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:22.340
Huh?

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:24.880
Momo, you're all still here?

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.590
Yuuki-kun, Yuuki-kun lovely!

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.600
She's drunk!?

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.600
I think so.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:38.690
One time when I drank Devilukean herb tea, I got drunk...

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:43.020
This drink does have Devilukean herbs in it.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:47.650
It looks like it's not suited to an Earthling's constitution.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.950
I'm sorry, Haruna!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.990
I'm okay.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.700
Will she be able to make it home like this?

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.960
Then why don't you walk her home, Rito-san?

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:01.380
Eh?

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.920
You're going to walk me home, Yuuki-kun?

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.470
I'm so happy!

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:13.100
There's no helping it, I guess I'll go home with you.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.810
In that case, I'll also...

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:17.310
What are you doing!?

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:20.390
Why don't you try reading the mood a little?

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:28.860
Hey... you have to support me better.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.320
I didn't think it would turn into something like this...

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.530
This is bad...

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:37.200
It may not have been alcohol, but she is drunk.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.580
If there were a teacher or someone here...

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.960
Oh, you two.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.830
Are you on your way home?

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.330
Hm?

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.590
Is she not feeling well?

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.460
Why does the principal always show up at times like this{...}?

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:50.760
Yo!

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:53.470
Looking sharp as usual today, principal!

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.140
Of course, I know.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.680
Are you... drunk?

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:00.930
Ah! Over there, it's Golden Darkness!

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.730
Yami-chan, where are you!? Where!?

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:05.730
Now's our chance!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.230
Yami-san, did you catch a cold?

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:12.280
No, but I have a bad feeling.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.950
We finally made it.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.870
Well, I'll be going now.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:20.790
Eh?

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.670
You're going home instead of nursing me?

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:40.140
Sairenji, why don't you drink this for now...?

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.690
Why are you getting undressed!?

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:46.520
Because it's so hot...

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.280
Just put your clothes on!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.410
I'm sorry...

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.790
Could it be... did she sober up from that?

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.920
It's so cool, it feels good.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.290
She's not sober at all!

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:10.840
I'm sorry!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.460
I'll get you a towel!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.630
No!

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:21.010
I won't let you go anywhere.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:29.860
Now I've got you all to myself.

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.950
Your bra is slipping...

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:36.070
Hm?

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:40.490
No... Don't look.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.870
It's okay now.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:46.000
It's not okay at all!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.540
W-Wait!

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.500
Anyway, I'm getting up now.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.840
No, I'm keeping you for myself.

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.880
I-I'm sorry.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.770
Geez, you're such a pervert, Yuuki-kun.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:09.900
Do you dislike being close to me?

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.400
It's not that.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.940
Really?

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:13.900
Really.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:16.400
I'm glad to hear that.

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:21.280
Haruna-chan, even if you're drunk this is...

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.870
Hey, Yuuki-kun?

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:26.120
Yes?

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:34.500
Would you be able to marry many girls at the same time and treat them all well?

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:45.850
What are you saying...

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:51.020
Momo-chan said that in space, marriages like that are normal.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:55.730
I wonder if something like that would go well...

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:02.030
I think that everyone would try to have the person they love for themselves...

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.040
Yuuki-kun, what do you think?

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:10.830
If I think about it with common sense-

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:17.050
I told you, that is common sense in space. So what do you think?

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:21.130
Actually... Sairenji, why are you asking me this suddenly?

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:24.550
Isn't that obvious?

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:28.560
Yuuki-kun, I...

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.650
Yuuki-kun, I...

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:37.690
Huh?

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.030
Ah?

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:46.870
Huh?

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.580
What am I doing!?

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:01.420
Could it be... You finally sobered up?

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.640
I... I'm sorry.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:09.430
I-I'm sorry too.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:10.810
I'm home!

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.190
Haruna!

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.020
I bought you a cake!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.320
Eh!?

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.650
You're doing that this early!?

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.070
That's not it, Onee-chan!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:24.660
This is because Sairenji wasn't... and I took her home! {incoherent babbling in the middle because he got flustered}

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:28.950
Anyway, she seems fine now, so I'm going home!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.660
Yuuki-kun!

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.580
Haruna.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:35.920
I'm sorry.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.960
I told you it isn't that!

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.890
I'm sorry, Rito-san.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.140
If I had seen Akiho-san sooner,

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:52.560
I could have stopped her from coming home.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:53.140
Momo!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:54.980
You were watching?

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.100
Of course!

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:00.190
Ah... that was close.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:01.110
In a number of ways.

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:06.200
Momo, Sairenji said...

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.450
That she would want to make the person she loves her own.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:10.080
Yes.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:15.000
So the harem plan is impossible after all.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.500
Even though she was drunk,

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:23.470
why do you think she was talking about that to you, Rito-san?

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:23.970
Eh?

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:29.350
A girl's heart is a complicated thing.

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:38.690
I really don't understand.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:55.210
Master... Where did you go?

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:14.390
<b>niwasaki yureru hana ga tsun to senobi de kotaeru</b>

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:14.390
<b>庭先揺れる花がツンと背伸びで応える</b>

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:14.390
<b>The flower swaying in the garden answers by stretching up</b>

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>tsumasakidachi de asa ni ohayou no kisu</b>

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>つま先立ちで朝におはようのKiss</b>

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>To give a good morning kiss standing on tiptoes</b>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:22.940
<b>saa yukou</b>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:22.940
<b>さあ行こう</b>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:22.940
<b>Now let's go!</b>

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:29.740
<b>fui ni tsumujikaze omowazu shagamikomu</b>

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:29.740
<b>不意につむじ風思わずしゃがみ込む</b>

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:29.740
<b>Caught off guard by the sudden whirlwind, I reflexively crouch down</b>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:42.040
<b>fuwari sukaato ni kakushita yowasatsuyoku haratte miseta</b>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:42.040
<b>ふわりスカートに隠した弱さ 強く払ってみせた</b>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:42.040
<b>I firmly brush off the weakness hidden inside my skirt</b>

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:51.090
<b>fuzoroi de sainan na nichijou ni sakihokorou</b>

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:51.090
<b>不揃いで災難な日常に咲き誇ろう</b>

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:51.090
<b>Let's bloom to our fullest in this strange everyday life full of misfortune</b>

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:59.270
<b>sunao ni sodatanai kara chanto mitenakucha</b>

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:59.270
<b>素直に育たないからちゃんと見てなくちゃ</b>

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:59.270
<b>I can't be honest, so you have to pay close attention</b>

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:07.280
<b>tameratta ano omoi sotto tsuchi ni umetanda</b>

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:07.280
<b>躊躇ったあの想いそっと土に埋めたんだ</b>

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:07.280
<b>I carefully buried the memory of my hesitance in the soil</b>

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:13.530
<b>A flower blooming in your heart</b>

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:18.830
<b>sono hi o yume mite</b>

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:18.830
<b>その日を夢見て</b>

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:18.830
<b>I dream of that day</b>

